# The bench's own environment (bench/README.md), pinned so CI's bench job runs
# what the comparison ran: the competitor libraries bench/competitors.py drives,
# at the versions each published run's usage.json records, and pytest. The
# package's own dependencies come from pyproject.toml's llm and bench extras.
